{"id":"wb-3-75","name":"岳麓书院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"岳麓书院","text":"岳麓书院位于中国湖南省长沙市岳麓区岳麓山东麓，是中国古代四大书院之一，始建于北宋开宝九年（976年），历经宋、元、明、清各代。迨及清光绪三十一年（1903年）改为湖南高等学堂，至今仍为湖南大学下属的办学机构，历史已逾千年，是世所罕见的“千年学府”。文化大革命期间岳麓书院以及岳麓山上一些其他文化遗迹遭到严重损毁，文革后修复。1988年被国务院批准为第三批全国重点文物保护单位，为岳麓山风景名胜区重要观光点。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B2%B3%E9%BA%93%E4%B9%A6%E9%99%A2","revisionId":95124183,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95124183","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fd3373d9502f725b5a3faa45.jpg","title":"Changsha_Yuelu_Shuyuan_2014.03.04_08-09-37_(adjusted).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Changsha_Yuelu_Shuyuan_2014.03.04_08-09-37_(adjusted).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/Changsha_Yuelu_Shuyuan_2014.03.04_08-09-37_%28adjusted%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​岳麓书院大门","width":320,"height":480}}